    "「%@」已由其他方式掛載，略過自動掛載。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” is already mounted by other means; skipping auto-mount."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”已通过其他方式挂载，跳过自动挂载。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」已由其他方式掛載，略過自動掛載。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」已由系統內建唯讀驅動掛載，可在清單中選擇「改用 MacNTFS 掛載」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” was mounted by the system's built-in read-only driver. Choose “Mount with MacNTFS” in the list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”已由系统内置的只读驱动挂载，可在列表中选择“改用 MacNTFS 挂载”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」已由系統內建唯讀驅動掛載，可在清單中選擇「改用 MacNTFS 掛載」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」已由系統內建唯讀驅動掛載，可在清單中選擇「改用 MacNTFS 掛載」以取得寫入能力。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” was mounted by the system's built-in read-only driver. Choose “Mount with MacNTFS” in the list to make it writable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”已由系统内置的只读驱动挂载，可在列表中选择“改用 MacNTFS 挂载”以获得写入能力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」已由系統內建唯讀驅動掛載，可在清單中選擇「改用 MacNTFS 掛載」以取得寫入能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」正在使用這顆磁碟。強制卸載可能讓它遺失尚未儲存的資料。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” is using this drive. Force unmounting may cause it to lose unsaved data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”正在使用这个磁盘。强制卸载可能导致它丢失尚未保存的数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」正在使用這顆磁碟。強制卸載可能讓它遺失尚未儲存的資料。"
